  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "黃昏美夢"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<h1><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">Hông-hun Bí-bāng</span></h1><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b><span><b>陳雷</b></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b><br /></b></span></p><p><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">（本文是漢羅合用kap全羅馬字一段一段對照）</span></b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán人逐暝做夢，m̄-kú khah常是精神就bē記得了了。最近一个夢，精神了，夢--裡ê代誌、對話、景緻……前前後後清清楚楚、實實在在，bē輸是tú-chiah ùi hit个現實ê世界tńg來chit个現實，m̄是做夢。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán lâng ta̍k mê chò-bāng, m̄-kú khah-siông sī cheng-sîn tō bē-kì-tit liáu-liáu. Chòe-kīn 1 ê bāng, cheng-sîn liáu, bāng--nih ê tāi-chì, tùi-ōe, kéng-tì.... chêng-chêng-āu-āu, chheng-chheng-chhó-chhó, si̍t-si̍t-chāi-chāi, bē-su sī tú-chiah ùi hit ê hiān-si̍t ê sè-kài tńg-lâi chit ê hiān-si̍t, m̄ sī chò-bāng.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我行來到一欉大樹跤。大枝樹oe下面吊一幅圖，差不多普通ê電視hiah大面，彩色粉筆畫--ê，真súi koh真熟sāi。Kā看，原來是台灣南部hit个草地小所在麻豆ê景緻——我ê故鄉ê田園。熱--人ê黃昏，一大phiàn金色ê稻仔。遠遠一chōa糖廠ê小火車teh走，一chat一chat，甘蔗囤tīⁿ-tīⁿ。詳細kā看，上下面角角仔一chōa幼字，霧霧讀無。可能是chit張圖ê名，或者畫ê人名，看--起-來真成我ê朋友林心智先生ê形體。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Góa kiâⁿ-lâi kàu 1 châng tōa-chhiū-kha. Tōa ki chhiū-oe ē-bīn tiàu 1 pak tô͘, chha-put-to phó͘-thong ê tiān-sī hiah tōa bīn, chhái-sek hún-pit ōe--ê, chin súi koh chin se̍k-sāi. Kā khòaⁿ, goân-lâi sī Tâi-oân lâm-pō͘ hit ê chháu-tē sió só͘-chāi Môa-tāu ê kéng-tì – góa ê kò͘-hiong ê chhân-hn̂g. Joa̍h--lâng ê hông-hun, 1 tōa phiàn kim-sek ê tiū-á. Hn̄g-hn̄g 1 chōa thn̂g-chhiúⁿ ê sió-hóe-chhia teh cháu, 1 chat 1 chat, kam-chià tún-tīⁿ-tīⁿ. Siông-sè kā khòaⁿ, siōng ē-bīn kak-kak-á 1 chōa iù jī, bū-bū tha̍k-bô. Khó-lêng sī chit tiuⁿ tô͘ ê miâ, he̍k-chiá ōe ê lâng-miâ, khòaⁿ--khí-lâi chin sêng góa ê pêng-iú Lîm Sim-tì sian-siⁿ ê hêng-thé.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">愈看愈愛，chiah-nī溫暖親切。心內想，chit張圖若是我ê，逐日陪我做伴，kám m̄是真好？拄好一个查埔人行--倚-來，30 thóng歲，做工人hit款。伊講chit幅圖是lán麻豆一个畫家，專工畫hō͘ lán麻豆一个台獨運動ê先輩。伊比大樹koh過--去hit間大厝，三層樓，綠色ê厝殼，講：「Chit幅圖本來是chit間美術博物館--ê，chit-má是我ê。」我看hit間大厝，就是我以前tī加拿大蹛ê厝，哪ē變做美術博物館？伊講chit張圖伊beh賣，開價美金42,000箍。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Jú khòaⁿ jú ài, chiah-nī un-loán chhin-chhiat. Sim-lāi siūⁿ, chit tiuⁿ tô͘ nā-sī góa ê, ta̍k-ji̍t pôe góa chò-phōaⁿ, kám m̄ sī chin hó? Tú-hó 1 ê cha-po͘-lâng kiâⁿ--óa-lâi, 30 thóng hòe, chò-kang-lâng hit khoán. I kóng chit pak tô͘ sī lán Môa-tāu 1 ê ōe-ka, choan-kang ōe hō͘ lán Môa-tāu 1 ê Tâi-to̍k ūn-tōng ê sian-pòe. I pí tōa-chhiū koh kòe--khì hit keng tōa-chhù, 3 chàn lâu, le̍k-sek ê chhù-khak, kóng: “Chit pak tô͘ pún-lâi sī chit keng bí-su̍t phok-bu̍t-koán--ê, chit-má sī góa ê.” Góa khòaⁿ hit keng tōa-chhù, tō sī góa í-chêng tī Ka-ná-tāi tòa ê chhù, ná ē piàn-chò bí-su̍t phok-bu̍t-koán? I kóng chit tiuⁿ tô͘ beh bē, khui-kè Bí-kim 42,000 kho͘.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">可惜bē赴kā買就精神--ah。醒--起-來透早3點30分。一時soah bē-hiáu分，iáu tī夢--裡，iah是tńg來tī另外一个現實。Tī我人生ê黃昏，真福氣夢chit个夢。我ê兩个故鄉——台灣kap加拿大——夢做一伙。看著chit幅súi圖，永遠記tī頭殼內。Kám是ùi另外一个平行ê宇宙（parallel&nbsp; universe）送--來ê信號？或者是親像阮麻豆ê鄉親文夏先生唱ê歌——黃昏ê故鄉teh叫我--leh？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Khó-sioh bē-hù kā bé tō cheng-sîn--ah. Chhéⁿ--khí-lâi thàu-chá 3 tiám 30 hun. Chi̍t-sî soah bē-hiáu hun, iáu tī bāng--nih, iah-sī tńg-lâi tī lēng-gōa 1 ê hiān-si̍t. Tī góa jîn-seng ê hông-hun, chin hok-khì bāng chit ê bāng. Góa ê 2 ê kò͘-hiong – Tâi-oân kap Ka-ná-tāi – bāng chò chi̍t-hóe. Khòaⁿ-tio̍h chit pak súi tô͘, éng-oán kì tī thâu-khak-lāi. Kám sī ùi lēng-gōa 1 ê pēng-hêng ê ú-tiū (parallel universe) sàng--lâi ê sìn-hō? He̍k-chiá sī chhin-chhiūⁿ goán Môa-tāu ê hiong-chhin Bûn-hē sian-siⁿ chhiò ê koa – hông-hun ê kò͘-hiong teh kiò--góa--leh?&nbsp;</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEijzj4JeokWqD4MaVJaasGs45RWvUJ9ZwGZP6_lMaxkJAaxiiqcy8RNHDEc4MnX193Xs6Kp5eZ23ovSv1DQaZvjWHII1Hn7hdjdjQT0Cd1s_oK0xrXiQxUbW7M-1Q-d0C3TaHtX3DUoAk9GVYG7UvM4RjHdkrYL-FBR1UTZPegORW7MLZVy5uXK6zrNfA/s1424/347%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEijzj4JeokWqD4MaVJaasGs45RWvUJ9ZwGZP6_lMaxkJAaxiiqcy8RNHDEc4MnX193Xs6Kp5eZ23ovSv1DQaZvjWHII1Hn7hdjdjQT0Cd1s_oK0xrXiQxUbW7M-1Q-d0C3TaHtX3DUoAk9GVYG7UvM4RjHdkrYL-FBR1UTZPegORW7MLZVy5uXK6zrNfA/w450-h640/347%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhrq3cdm4QHRCfvTsPWhhiSTgtM4wOauKRXzFt5XZ1TZUQi_DRu8rrTSRHzlvZa26SVnrIJagxT9PqA5J-7n-uqYNtEcOHw96zpckS4xEDLJ5v4fnQr-TWlkjVdsg96oyQTvs7G-mafxBDSVZlCQ54sLAgosgOHgga0vG4X4epzF13aERyHtOBp7sT8Bg/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1347%E6%9C%9F_044.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/A